WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:10,610
Keep an eye on her, don't alert her, and report her location at any time

2
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:14,280
What a spy

3
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:17,160
I never thought a spy would show up next to me

4
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:19,000
I don’t know what the spy’s purpose is.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,920
Boss, I see you're not frowning

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,360
Did something happen to the company?

7
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,560
No big deal

8
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:25,440
Wang Hao handles some more security details

9
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:30,440
On the first day when Tian was assigned a house, he came directly to the door.

10
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,120
This woman is so brave

11
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:34,040
But I have to see what she wants to do

12
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:36,000
Find Qian and open the door

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Liu Qingyi came over

14
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,880
What is she doing here so late?

15
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,950
It's almost half past nine

16
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,590
You two are not going back to the dormitory to rest.

17
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:44,190
What are you doing here, boss?

18
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,710
Secretary Zhao, don’t get me wrong.

19
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:47,990
December 1st is the first auction.

20
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:49,710
As an auctioneer, I have no idea.

21
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:50,630
Deliberately holding the fragrance

22
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:52,390
Let’s go to the boss and give him a slap in the face together

23
00:00:52,390 --> 00:00:54,830
Hello Secretary Zhao, Hello Boss.

24
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:55,830
Now that you're here, come in and do it
